msgstr "⟪k:0⟫獣が白い髪の娘と出会い、⟪k:1⟫人らしさを得ていく……そんなお話に。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_62228A2A_0C5A_41F9_A8AC_B3ABE806B459
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e062ea47529e6ad2ed4c506cbd0c999d19fe967b5165fa6405395af47f5e7f0
#. default-sha256: 688f24f3068c0a49ca8f0b1d9bdb0fb5f4a8dfafd1b234d06e3935cf36704cc1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_62228A2A_0C5A_41F9_A8AC_B3ABE806B459"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That tale would have been far easier on you, I’m sure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その方が――ずいぶんと、⟪k:1⟫気も楽だったのではありませんか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7242c6f58b6bd8ed07480cf06484728b1d2401aef30455ca5df394468affea7
#. default-sha256: f81bc65f2e6aa4e9ec4af15a94b257870e7fdb779bdc65ddd74635fe32dc3bf7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By remaining in the dark...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and seeing the story through his eyes alone...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"you would not have had to witness that poor girl’s miserable death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫知らない方が……、⟪k:1⟫獣と同じ目線でいた方が……、⟪k:2⟫哀れな女性の死を知らずにいられたのですか"
"ら。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_77A688CC_59DB_4A8A_80D6_2805FD5F2A7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0344470c1ad1682791552b99531cb1a051c89c4d165f3e3c44c5af63e1ed1667
#. default-sha256: 7e0b6a0a9210255459d36c2d3373ea0858c7e57b074ffa80493abfc91aa43286
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_77A688CC_59DB_4A8A_80D6_2805FD5F2A7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that, perhaps, would have been better for you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その方が、⟪k:1⟫あなた様のためだったのかもしれませんね……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_73EE22AD_3CAF_4942_824E_45B6B1CDBEE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 039c594b3a0723a9edc175c3879c6ffea5c258479ec800ba8ffb8c4b81dd3f25
#. default-sha256: c5375803cd3b3848ea6226b2a7d24ab3b0465b08768f76db0d40f95ffc670a05
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_73EE22AD_3CAF_4942_824E_45B6B1CDBEE0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the reality you observed through her eyes changes the “truth” of his tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでもあなた様が、⟪k:1⟫彼女の視点から真実を見たのであれば、⟪k:2⟫彼の事実も変わってくるで"
"しょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F06712C1_33E1_46A7_A834_ABA7C4446DD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fce5863c40da3254a3b5e83edf28b48be124b567c8fb07c4cb4870f96451361
