msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_89DD8F69_6BF8_4447_95E2_60A204FA750B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The poor young woman who called upon the mansion did, indeed, resemble Bestia."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫館に訪れた哀れな女性は――、⟪k:1⟫そう、⟪k:2⟫確かに……ベステアと似ていたかもしれません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_13DF9A7B_EC52_4D1F_8FD2_14F26ED935D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cce9c6578e98c4335bebb903d525381b2d0f06030ed52db6caddaa2ca030d72e
