msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3DEB76D0_C400_41A6_86CB_AADC4D54BC79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Half of her blood was of the same race as his."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の血の半分は、⟪k:1⟫彼と同じ種だったのでしょうね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B269F7E_7BD0_4536_B157_071365C1498D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab47cffe07564cb5062658fd5db9975381ca12212b54dc29096b69553efe88c7
#. default-sha256: b01e9930df1342a7bdd25499cdf11e219f4b585b5e4b3abf0472060695e0d717
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B269F7E_7BD0_4536_B157_071365C1498D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But was that the only reason?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Would that be enough for him to mistake her for a "
"beast?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫それだけなのでしょうか？⟪k:2⟫　ただそれだけで、⟪k:3⟫獣と見間違うのでしょうか？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9C5A2C33_8B58_4458_8D69_BF0232B854AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 642ef6b2136ee6843437743bc26934dcdb572516e041d723e8716ee9e5a6281b
