msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_98F60F19_0750_4D1D_92B7_3425D74D193D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that is simply my own speculation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps he had merely lost his grip on "
"reality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ええ……これは、⟪k:1⟫わたくしの憶測でございます。⟪k:2⟫単にベステアは、⟪k:3⟫とうに気が触れていた"
"だけかもしれません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe116a8c18818c13fe11ed1501669e307c88d59edd2b4bc0e7ffe3f5de8606c0
