msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How well have you come to understand Bestia, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫旦那さまは、⟪k:1⟫ベステアについて――どれほどお分かりになっていましたか？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95a26c5686b206e0ef0f1575bac29cacd3fef42067ccbe01919e05a65c8711b1
#. default-sha256: d2f0684b56a7c92921f1a7e707f98e6c89c27deec67400d24e53d73507b6892b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫do⟪k:2⟫ appear to think he was an ordinary human who believed himself to be a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼が、⟪k:1⟫獣と思い込んでいるだけの普通の人間……。⟪k:2⟫こうは、⟪k:3⟫思っていただけたような気が"
"するのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bff75e5963f8c5dd4d41accfff38a5ba009f6cd5cf8c9de77f2bd30896a97a0b
#. default-sha256: 71b6fe925c1df8236c008e6a221ca9f3e093e68dc4178cb7871eb0c9ca901fb4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But where... ⟪k:1⟫does the line between man and beast truly lie?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし……、⟪k:1⟫人と獣の境界というのは、⟪k:2⟫本当はどこにあるのでしょう？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3FD44329_FA98_4D23_9759_54C51EFC9104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cba19da5be1f28a1191078cba1a66d5a53bf40f2df514ebe5f875435049fb68
#. default-sha256: 1b355ecd68222f45c443bab3de75a7bf7ed3fdef8415ef9bb57e232772d04a9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3FD44329_FA98_4D23_9759_54C51EFC9104"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That I do not know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしには分かりません……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_DA791398_946B_4073_A5E2_43A80A4225D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d59c99ecf63691529a9977fcdb0d81ec851be55c3b096640162cdca104194a40
