msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DA791398_946B_4073_A5E2_43A80A4225D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Master, if—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like Bestia—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫you were to lose your memories and endure "
"persecution and degradation until you broke..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……ねえ、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま。⟪k:2⟫あなた様は――たとえば彼のように⟪k:3⟫記憶を失い……、⟪k:4⟫虐げられ精"
"神を壊したとしても……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2455FA0D_CF54_4510_864E_951197A99F35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d69b35b9789492f6bba0304f126e28a3591a3665f052808391f1604ab79e3e2a
#. default-sha256: e5756f71cc9b13abf0cc6b37ee555bdbd399b992f71e9999bd66eeb82f366cde
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2455FA0D_CF54_4510_864E_951197A99F35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫would you still remember those you care for?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大事な人のことは、⟪k:1⟫忘れませんよね……？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BA8FEFFF_B069_4A73_8260_AC368B269E5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d571fd7e1d371dac7fadcf501cc50d990af4a1a2136a0a9236f0ee9f99f8df7
#. default-sha256: 1ad229f0193c625f60c60257d382b3e0980ffab2da56ccb0290dc4ab1e944b7b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA8FEFFF_B069_4A73_8260_AC368B269E5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Now, our tale is not yet over.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The web of misfortune was tightly, oh so tightly "
"entangled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……さあ、⟪k:1⟫お話は終わりではありません。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫不幸の糸は深く深く絡んでまいりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_DB158C2D_F0EB_422E_947E_27340295256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f85ddf7a5ac2871f3bee7166bda66495f4a9008f4c8ad4bb9e826985d159657a
