msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6DF558A9_07FA_4263_8278_50C319BB4406"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just after the White-Haired Girl had disrobed, showing Bestia the difference between her and "
"him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫ちょうど――白い髪の娘がその身を晒すことで、⟪k:2⟫ベステアと自分の違いを教えたところ"
"でございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2567FF9A_5979_4306_94FE_B40470F900B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e82d8c95de691a1759583fbdd63328d5ccd11f2e7b8bf094ab41267fb4e6c438
#. default-sha256: d0974d38e0bc32f9c978cbbab11a3fdb94b8cbaf734da1c5d2f1df4414397cfa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2567FF9A_5979_4306_94FE_B40470F900B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was, yes, several days following the young woman’s death.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The blood in the "
"hall had been cleaned up,⟪k:3⟫and there was no trace of it any longer."
msgstr ""
